# No web verification

After code changes, deploys, or VPS restarts:

- Do **not** open the app in a browser (including cursor-ide-browser / browsermcp)
- Do **not** curl/fetch the public site or local preview URL to "verify" the page
- Do **not** screenshot or interact with the UI for confirmation

The user verifies the webpage themselves. Report commit/push/service status only; stop after deploy/restart succeeds.
